# Agon 08_sand_casualpirates layers 6+7: the forced run (tools/cov/force.sh with
# tools/cov/specs/metroid_force.py). First GetOrigin's actor branch with a zero direction: the
# player is teleported away, the pirate u04d8 and the metroid u0547 are placed on the same point
# (exactly equal X/Y, so (this - target).ToVec2f() cannot be normalized) and the metroid takes the
# pirate as its target; the team manager positions its members every few frames, so the placement
# is re-done over a window. Then damage (GetGrowthStage), nine Deactivate messages so SwarmRemove
# runs with each forced team id in turn (three each: kInvalidUniqueId, an id no object has, the
# other team), and four Attacks on the pirate's target for PreDamageSpacePirate.
@f300 layer 6
@f340 layer 7
@f560 god 1; give morphBall 1; give powerBombs 5; give missile 20
@f580 send u0547 Activate; send u053d Activate; send u0539 Activate
@f600 tp 300 -300 0
@f610 place u04d8 355.43 -240.26 3.79; place u0547 355.43 -240.26 3.79; fsm u0547 SelectTarget
@f700 place u04d8 355.43 -240.26 3.79; place u0547 355.43 -240.26 3.79
@f800 place u04d8 355.43 -240.26 3.79; place u0547 355.43 -240.26 3.79
